This directory is intentionally empty in source control.

AlarmForegroundService uses the device's own default alarm sound
(RingtoneManager.TYPE_ALARM) rather than a bundled audio file, so nothing
needs to be added here for the alarm to work. Keep this .gitkeep only if
you later want to bundle a custom fallback sound as res/raw/alarm_loop.*
and wire it in as an alternative to the system default.
